## psc/driver/web_assets.pengu — copia e inyección de artefactos web.
##
## Lee `[web]` de `pengu.toml`, copia scripts y assets al directorio del
## artefacto y añade `<script src="...">` antes de `</head>`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Todas las funciones liberan lo que crean salvo el `result` devuelto, que el
## llamador consume.

import std.archivum
import std.spark
import std.compass
import std.scrolls

import psc.driver.manifest
import psc.sema.names as npool

insignia psc_driver_web_assets_

## `true` si hay algo configurado en `[web]`.
##
## ## Memoria
## O(1).
weave configured with man as ref to Manifest into bool:
    return (man->web_scripts.len > 0) or (man->web_assets.len > 0)

## Convierte un nombre de archivo en un `src` seguro para atributo HTML.
##
## Solo se permiten letras, dígitos, `.`, `_`, `-` y `/`; el resto se rechaza
## para no inyectar markup.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve string owned.
weave safe_src with name as string into result of string to string:
    var b as ref to frozen byte is bytes of name
    var i as int is 0
    while i < (name length):
        var c as int is ((b at i) to int)
        var ok as bool is (c >= 97 and c <= 122) or (c >= 65 and c <= 90) or (c >= 48 and c <= 57) or c == 46 or c == 95 or c == 45 or c == 47
        if not ok:
            return calling err_of with "invalid web path: {name}"
        set i is i + 1
    return calling ok_of with (calling npool.copy_string with name)

## Copia un asset (archivo o directorio) al directorio de salida.
##
## ## Memoria
## No retiene handles.
weave copy_asset with src as string, outdir as string into result of bool to string:
    if not (calling archivum.exists with src):
        return calling err_of with "web asset not found: {src}"
    var base as string is calling compass.basename with src
    defer banish base
    var dst as string is "{outdir}/{base}"
    defer banish dst
    if calling archivum.is_dir with src:
        if not (calling archivum.copy_tree with src, dst):
            return calling err_of with "cannot copy web asset directory: {src}"
        return calling ok_of with true
    if not (calling archivum.copy_file with src, dst, true):
        return calling err_of with "cannot copy web asset: {src}"
    return calling ok_of with true

## Copia un script al directorio de salida y devuelve su nombre base.
##
## ## Memoria
## El nombre devuelto es owned.
weave copy_script with src as string, outdir as string into result of string to string:
    if not (calling archivum.is_file with src):
        return calling err_of with "web script not found: {src}"
    var base as string is calling compass.basename with src
    defer banish base
    var dst as string is "{outdir}/{base}"
    defer banish dst
    if not (calling archivum.copy_file with src, dst, true):
        return calling err_of with "cannot copy web script: {src}"
    return calling ok_of with (calling npool.copy_string with base)

## Inyecta los tags de scripts en el HTML.
##
## ## Memoria
## Devuelve el HTML owned; libera el original.
weave inject_scripts with html as string, tags as string into result of string to string:
    var existing as int is calling scrolls.index_of with html, tags
    if existing >= 0:
        return calling ok_of with (calling npool.copy_string with html)
    var idx as int is calling scrolls.index_of with html, "</head>"
    if idx < 0:
        return calling ok_of with "{tags}\n{html}"
    var before as string is calling html.get_substring with 0, idx
    var after as string is calling html.get_substring with idx, (html length)
    defer banish before
    defer banish after
    return calling ok_of with "{before}{tags}\n{after}"

## Aplica `[web]` al artefacto.
##
## ## Retorno
## `ok=true` si no había configuración o si todo se copió e inyectó.
##
## ## Errores
## Path inválido, script/asset ausente, fallo de copia o HTML sin `</head>`
## (en ese caso se inyecta al principio, que también carga antes del loader).
##
## ## Memoria
## Consume el resultado el llamador.
weave apply_web with man as ref to Manifest, artifact as string into result of bool to string:
    if not (calling configured with man):
        return calling ok_of with true
    var outdir as string is calling compass.dirname with artifact
    defer banish outdir
    var webdir as string is "{man->base_dir}/{man->web_dir}"
    defer banish webdir
    var tags as string is ""
    defer banish tags
    for name in man->web_scripts:
        var src as string is "{webdir}/{name}"
        defer banish src
        var cr as result of string to string is calling copy_script with src, outdir
        if not cr.is_ok:
            var msg as string is cr.error
            return calling err_of with "{msg} (src={src})"
        var safe as result of string to string is calling safe_src with cr.value
        banish cr.value
        if not safe.is_ok:
            var smsg as string is safe.error
            return calling err_of with smsg
        set tags is "{tags}<script src=\"{man->web_base}{safe.value}\"></script>\n"
        banish safe.value
    for name in man->web_assets:
        var src as string is "{webdir}/{name}"
        defer banish src
        var ar as result of bool to string is calling copy_asset with src, outdir
        if not ar.is_ok:
            var amsg as string is ar.error
            return calling err_of with amsg
    var htmlm as maybe string is calling archivum.read_text with artifact
    if not htmlm.is_present:
        return calling err_of with "cannot read web artifact: {artifact}"
    var html as string is htmlm.value
    defer banish html
    var inj as result of string to string is calling inject_scripts with html, tags
    if not inj.is_ok:
        var imsg as string is inj.error
        return calling err_of with imsg
    if not (calling archivum.write_text with artifact, inj.value):
        banish inj.value
        return calling err_of with "cannot write web artifact: {artifact}"
    banish inj.value
    return calling ok_of with true
